{"parentUuid":"6049021e-e6fd-4429-9020-0de5f410062c","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"c9deaf31-b582-4506-a5e2-2f1d0cb252fe","agentId":"a2942aa597e9497c1","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_bdrk_01GJntsKoiaEYWxpWgQynW9t","type":"tool_result","content":"Hashcards\n\nA plain text-based spaced repetition system.\n\nFeatures:\n- Store flashcards as plain Markdown files (front/back and cloze cards supported).\n- Content-addressable cards: cards are identified by the hash of their text.\n- Low friction: edit cards with your editor of choice; use standard tools and VCS.\n- Efficient scheduling using an established spaced-repetition algorithm.\n\nExample deck (a Markdown file):\n\n```\nQ: How many neurons are there in the human brain?\nA: ~80 billion.\n\nC: An [agonist] is a ligand that binds to a receptor and [activates it].\n```\n\nInstallation\n\nDownload a pre-built binary from the project's releases page: https://github.com/eudoxia0/hashcards/releases\n\nUsage\n\nStart a drilling session for a directory containing your Markdown decks:\n\n```\n$ hashcards drill [DIRECTORY]\n```\n\nCommon commands\n\n- drill [DIRECTORY]      Start a drilling session (launches a local web interface).\n- stats [DIRECTORY]      Print collection statistics (JSON output supported).\n- check [DIRECTORY]      Check integrity of a collection.\n- orphans list|delete    Manage orphan cards in a collection.\n- export [DIRECTORY]     Export a collection to JSON (prints to stdout by default).\n\nConfiguration & data\n\nRuntime data (such as review progress) is stored in a collection database (e.g. an SQLite file) in the root of your card collection directory. This README intentionally omits implementation-specific details (internal schemas, build instructions, and developer notes).\n\nFor detailed user-oriented documentation and examples, see the example/ directory (if present) in this repository.\n\nLICENSE\n\nThis project is distributed under the terms of the LICENSE file included in this repository.","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"d3675c0d-5778-490d-8b42-4fe07f90cdda","timestamp":"2026-08-08T23:30:13.230Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"6049021e-e6fd-4429-9020-0de5f410062c","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-cli","cwd":"/workspace","sessionId":"40958aa3-b7af-43b4-b441-e420339d7c49","version":"2.1.207","gitBranch":"master"}
